{
    "About": "Look presets (LOOK-S0): a project's look in one pick (Project Settings > Look, or the look-apply edscript command). Camera and Post are partial Camera / PostProcess component JSON merged onto every camera in the scene (a missing PostProcess is added); Material replaces the material of meshes still on the stock StandardMaterial when applied with materials; Import sets the texture import defaults for new images (Format, MIPs); Caps (the HardwareProfiles.json Caps shape) are a project-wide cap layer, the stricter cap winning over the hardware profile and the player's quality; \"Lite\": true adds the Lite pipeline caps (no SSAO, shadows or image-based lighting, for low-end PCs and handhelds). A project's Assets/Config/LookPresets.json adds presets or replaces one with the same Name.",
